{"t":"HON","made":"2026-11-19 01:25","name":"Honeywell International Inc.","ko":"허니웰","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Conglomerates","employees":101000,"hq":"Charlotte, NC, United States","website":"https://www.honeywell.com","summary_en":"Honeywell International Inc. engages in the industrial automation, building automation, and energy and sustainability solutions businesses in the United States, Europe, and internationally. The Industrial Automation segment provides automation control and instrumentation products and services; smart energy products; sensing technologies, including custom-engineered sensors and related services; gas detection technologies and personal protective equipment; and system design automation equipment, as well as software and analytics for manufacturing, distribution, and fulfillment operations. The Building Automation segment provides software applications for building control and optimization; sensors, switches, control systems, and instruments for energy management; access control; video surveillance; fire products; and installation, maintenance, and system upgrade services. The Energy and Sustainability Solutions segment, through its UOP business, delivers licensed process technology, equipment, engineering, catalysts, adsorbents, and services for refining, petrochemicals, low-carbon energy, gas and LNG, and industrial solutions, as well as connectivity, data integration, and software solutions. The company also offers Forge Cognition, a self-contained agentic AI and simulation platform for facility operations. The company was formerly known as AlliedSignal, Inc. Honeywell International Inc. was founded in 1885 and is headquartered in Charlotte, North Carolina.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Honeywell International Inc.는 미국, 유럽 및 국제적으로 산업 자동화, 건물 자동화, 에너지 및 지속 가능성 솔루션 사업에 종사하고 있습니다. 산업 자동화 부문은 자동화 제어 및 계측 제품과 서비스를 제공합니다. 스마트 에너지 제품; 맞춤형 엔지니어링 센서 및 관련 서비스를 포함한 감지 기술; 가스 감지 기술 및 개인 보호 장비; 제조, 유통, 이행 작업을 위한 소프트웨어 및 분석은 물론 시스템 설계 자동화 장비도 포함됩니다. 빌딩 자동화 부문은 빌딩 제어 및 최적화를 위한 소프트웨어 애플리케이션을 제공합니다. 에너지 관리용 센서, 스위치, 제어 시스템 및 기기; 접근 제어; 비디오 감시; 화재 제품; 설치, 유지관리, 시스템 업그레이드 서비스를 제공합니다. 에너지 및 지속 가능성 솔루션 부문은 UOP 사업을 통해 정유, 석유화학, 저탄소 에너지, 가스 및 LNG, 산업 솔루션을 위한 허가된 공정 기술, 장비, 엔지니어링, 촉매, 흡착제 및 서비스는 물론 연결성, 데이터 통합 ​​및 소프트웨어 솔루션을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 또한 시설 운영을 위한 독립형 에이전트 AI 및 시뮬레이션 플랫폼인 Forge Cognition을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 AlliedSignal, Inc.로 알려져 있었습니다. Honeywell International Inc.는 1885년에 설립되었으며 노스캐롤라이나주 샬럿에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":220.07,"mcap":69841092608.0,"pe":10.910759,"fpe":22.284058,"peg":3.007,"ps":1.8504382,"pb":3.1155503,"ev_ebitda":8.958,"div":1.28,"beta":0.878,"hi52":260.28317,"lo52":195.86786},"fin":{"rev":37743001600.0,"rev_g":0.013,"eps_g":-0.636,"gross":0.3721,"op":0.20263,"net":0.18684,"roe":0.44387,"fcf":7022000128.0,"cash":6185999872.0,"debt":17240000512.0,"de":76.101,"eps":20.17,"feps":9.87567},"own":{"short":0.0208,"inst":0.81636,"insider":0.00058},"analyst":{"n":23,"mean":253.86957,"median":255.0,"high":290.0,"low":186.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.0,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":11,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":11,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":11,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":3,"buy":12,"hold":8,"sell":0,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-23","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":271.0,"priorPriceTarget":270.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-23","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":241.0,"priorPriceTarget":240.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-23","Firm":"Evercore ISI Group","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":270.0,"priorPriceTarget":265.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-23","Firm":"RBC Capit